---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /contato/
title: "Contato - CSTatics Brasil"
description: "Fale com a equipe do CSTatics Brasil: correções em lineups, sugestões de táticas e propostas de parceria."
---

<section class="contact-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Canal aberto</span>
        <h1 class="section-head__title">Fale com a equipe</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="section-head__rule"></div>
    </div>

    <p class="contact-lead">
      Correção em um lineup, sugestão de tática ou proposta de parceria — escreva
      e a equipe responde.
    </p>

    <div class="contact-content">
      <div class="contact-panel hud">
        <i class="hud-brackets" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h2 class="contact-panel__title">Enviar mensagem</h2>
        {% include "components/contact-form.njk" %}
      </div>

      <aside class="contact-info hud">
        <i class="hud-brackets" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h2 class="contact-panel__title">Canais diretos</h2>

        <ul class="contact-channels">
          <li>
            <span class="contact-channels__label datum"><i class="fa-brands fa-instagram" aria-hidden="true"></i> Instagram</span>
            <a href="{{ site.social.instagram }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@cstaticsbr</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="contact-channels__label datum"><i class="fa-brands fa-youtube" aria-hidden="true"></i> YouTube</span>
            <a href="{{ site.social.youtube }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@cstaticsbr</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="contact-channels__label datum"><i class="fa-brands fa-tiktok" aria-hidden="true"></i> TikTok</span>
            <a href="{{ site.social.tiktok }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@cstaticsbr</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="contact-channels__label datum"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope" aria-hidden="true"></i> E-mail</span>
            <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p class="contact-note">
          Reportou um erro em um lineup? Cite o mapa e o nome da jogada — a
          correção entra na fila de validação.
        </p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact-section { padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem) 0 clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6rem); }

  .contact-lead {
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    max-width: 58ch;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2xl);
  }

  .contact-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--spacing-xl);
    align-items: start;
    max-width: none;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .contact-panel,
  .contact-info {
    padding: var(--spacing-xl);
    background: transparent;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 0;
    height: auto;
    backdrop-filter: none;
  }

  .contact-panel__title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    padding-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .contact-channels { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }

  .contact-channels li {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    padding: var(--spacing-md) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
  }

  .contact-channels li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .contact-channels__label {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5em;
  }

  .contact-channels__label i { color: var(--color-primary); }

  .contact-channels a {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .contact-channels a:hover { color: var(--color-primary); }

  .contact-note {
    margin: var(--spacing-lg) 0 0;
    padding-top: var(--spacing-md);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .contact-content { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
